WEBVTT

00:01:59.282 --> 00:02:03.494
but this is like dial up speeds
at the beginning of the Internet.

00:02:03.911 --> 00:02:05.705
This is a new Moore's Law.

00:02:05.746 --> 00:02:07.540
We're just getting started.

00:02:10.126 --> 00:02:12.461
(Laughter)

00:02:12.503 --> 00:02:14.630
(Applause)

00:02:14.630 --> 00:02:15.965
That's Philip.

00:02:17.842 --> 00:02:20.261
This has been the dream
of patients and caregivers,

00:02:20.261 --> 00:02:22.346
doctors and scientists, for decades,

00:02:22.346 --> 00:02:23.973
and for good reason.

00:02:24.557 --> 00:02:27.518
You may know someone who's lost
the ability to use their hands,

00:02:27.560 --> 00:02:29.979
maybe from a stroke
or a spinal cord injury